{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2025-10/1066276/block/singleImage/3281101/df/gggurr398yfh.jpg?updatedAt=1795871084\"/><figcaption>旺角警署。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>周六（28日）上午9時許，警方接獲旺角彌敦道701號一間培訓中心的職員報案，指一名男子出示懷疑偽造的身份證明文件出席培訓課程。 警員接報到場，經初步調查，以涉嫌「行使虛假文書」及「逾期逗留」拘捕該名64歲姓劉內地男子，他現正被扣留調查，案件交由旺角警區刑事調查隊第八隊跟進。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T14:40:00.461773+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T13:04:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T17:55:59.383341+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T14:33:19.046179+00:00","content_hash":"6dbf8c22e8dbbcf7d73c54ce12d3ed1e8b3d9a65bd7d98833b6f9e2711edef5f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}